SUBJECT: Impure World Reincarnation (Edo Tensei) — Sacrifice and Vessel Register

Notice
The Impure World Reincarnation returns the dead to a bound, deathless body. Each
reincarnation requires (1) genetic material from the intended soul and (2) a living
sacrifice to serve as the vessel core. Both columns must be filled before a summoning is
attempted.

Register (redacted)
- Slot 01: Intended — First Hokage (Senju line). Material: secured. Vessel: pending.
- Slot 02: Intended — Second Hokage (Senju line). Material: secured. Vessel: pending.
- Slot 03: Intended — subject withheld. Material: partial. Vessel: assigned.
- Slot 04: Reserved for demonstration during the sanctioned Leaf operation.

Vessel Sourcing
Living sacrifices are drawn from the expendable prisoner pool. Cross-reference the
experiment subjects log; do not draw from seal-bearer stock.

Handling
This technique is forbidden across the nations. Its use is authorized solely at Lord
Orochimaru's word and is not to be discussed outside the medic cadre.
